8.3 Accept All

When the visitor selects Accept All:

* Save the relevant consent preferences.
* Record the consent categories and a suitable consent timestamp.
* Update the consent state.
* Close the panel.
* Respect the saved choice on subsequent visits.
* Enable only the optional technologies covered by the accepted categories and applicable consent requirements.

